    "message": "Compare a model suite with its per-domain form in policy comparisons\n\nwith_behavior_policy_variant rewrites a generated Scenario's model suite\nas schema-2 per-domain selectors and drops the v2-only sleep debt weight,\nso every variant pair of a generated Scenario was refused (#157). The\ncomparison now treats the two forms as one input when both the declared\nnon-behavior models and the per-domain selectors the runtime reads agree.\nA suite that leaves a selector implicit still differs once expanded, so\nthat pair stays refused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
